{"4347010":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Just One Bite","steam_appid":4347010,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/22ea276529e73b94f655464fad3538d1.avif?t=1793724844\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras_big\/22ea276529e73b94f655464fad3538d1.webp?t=1793724844 width=1560 height=447 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, monsters began to appear inside food all around the world.<br>Your mission is to become a wooden puppet crafted by humans and gather as much food as possible.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5a477c15f7588cd3293e18813808a72c.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5a477c15f7588cd3293e18813808a72c.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5a477c15f7588cd3293e18813808a72c.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food? Monster?<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is that really food in front of you?<br>You won’t know until it’s already in your mouth.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/397be6ec68d39b1fe34bcdff079259e7.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/397be6ec68d39b1fe34bcdff079259e7.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/397be6ec68d39b1fe34bcdff079259e7.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Weapon<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield a powerful weapon you can control freely—<br>it will act as your very hands and feet. Find the weapons that suit you best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/94c529bd87aa2ca59067fb632fb19994.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/94c529bd87aa2ca59067fb632fb19994.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/94c529bd87aa2ca59067fb632fb19994.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/1af5d9863f3aea4540413f98d0118a27.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/1af5d9863f3aea4540413f98d0118a27.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/1af5d9863f3aea4540413f98d0118a27.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your weapon to grab food and items, then use them in combat. Sometimes, even your teammates can become great weapons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5154726e0c62cd18e23c3d671b8aa078.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5154726e0c62cd18e23c3d671b8aa078.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5154726e0c62cd18e23c3d671b8aa078.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Truck<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modified truck with various functions will help you. Ride the truck to a safe zone and prepare for your next adventure.<br>but don’t expect it to be very sturdy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/4049864e61114f6f10fe9b45152d3278.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/4049864e61114f6f10fe9b45152d3278.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/4049864e61114f6f10fe9b45152d3278.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Food Into Money!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, food <i>is<\/i> money.<br>Use the food you collect to upgrade your fork and your body.<br>Will you be able to complete every mission? What reward awaits you at the end?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/906699cae9693ef19ec754b20de4d6fd.avif?t=1793724844\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras_big\/906699cae9693ef19ec754b20de4d6fd.webp?t=1793724844 width=1560 height=447 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/22ea276529e73b94f655464fad3538d1.avif?t=1793724844\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras_big\/22ea276529e73b94f655464fad3538d1.webp?t=1793724844 width=1560 height=447 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, monsters began to appear inside food all around the world.<br>Your mission is to become a wooden puppet crafted by humans and gather as much food as possible.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5a477c15f7588cd3293e18813808a72c.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5a477c15f7588cd3293e18813808a72c.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5a477c15f7588cd3293e18813808a72c.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food? Monster?<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is that really food in front of you?<br>You won’t know until it’s already in your mouth.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/397be6ec68d39b1fe34bcdff079259e7.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/397be6ec68d39b1fe34bcdff079259e7.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/397be6ec68d39b1fe34bcdff079259e7.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Weapon<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield a powerful weapon you can control freely—<br>it will act as your very hands and feet. Find the weapons that suit you best.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/94c529bd87aa2ca59067fb632fb19994.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/94c529bd87aa2ca59067fb632fb19994.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/94c529bd87aa2ca59067fb632fb19994.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/1af5d9863f3aea4540413f98d0118a27.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/1af5d9863f3aea4540413f98d0118a27.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/1af5d9863f3aea4540413f98d0118a27.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your weapon to grab food and items, then use them in combat. Sometimes, even your teammates can become great weapons.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5154726e0c62cd18e23c3d671b8aa078.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5154726e0c62cd18e23c3d671b8aa078.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/5154726e0c62cd18e23c3d671b8aa078.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Truck<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modified truck with various functions will help you. Ride the truck to a safe zone and prepare for your next adventure.<br>but don’t expect it to be very sturdy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/4049864e61114f6f10fe9b45152d3278.poster.avif?t=1793724844\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/4049864e61114f6f10fe9b45152d3278.webm?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/4049864e61114f6f10fe9b45152d3278.mp4?t=1793724844\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Food Into Money!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, food <i>is<\/i> money.<br>Use the food you collect to upgrade your fork and your body.<br>Will you be able to complete every mission? What reward awaits you at the end?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras\/906699cae9693ef19ec754b20de4d6fd.avif?t=1793724844\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/extras_big\/906699cae9693ef19ec754b20de4d6fd.webp?t=1793724844 width=1560 height=447 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A 1~4 player co-op horror game. Your mission is to gather as much food as possible for the humans. But not all food is normal. Can you complete this mission to the very end?","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Korean, Vietnamese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/5f0fa0524b299d3f7a1da44854ace2f85fb0549a\/header.jpg?t=1793724844","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/a674df56558a72e039ac245c9869a4e98362babe\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793724844","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/a674df56558a72e039ac245c9869a4e98362babe\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793724844","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4590 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 \/ AMD Radeon R9 390<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Opus Nine"],"publishers":["Opus Nine"],"demos":[{"appid":4931580,"description":""}],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":579,"final":521,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"5,79€","final_formatted":"5,21€"},"packages":[1519384],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Just One Bite","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1519384,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Just One Bite - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">5,79€<\/span> 5,21€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":521}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/e77bed4c3fe29f146d20033b03e9c50a158de946\/ss_e77bed4c3fe29f146d20033b03e9c50a158de946.600x338.jpg?t=1793724844","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4347010\/e77bed4c3fe29f146d20033b03e9c50a158de946\/ss_e77bed4c3fe29f